    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine some letters, make some words, get some cool stuff it\u2019s that simple. Whether you\u2019re here to flex your vocab or just chill and see what you find, there\u2019s always something fun waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Nodes of Letters</strong>: dive into a world full of possibilities! Strategically gather the letters you need, piece them together, and see what words (and surprises) you can create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine Letters into Words</strong>: The longer and more clever your creations, the bigger the rewards! Get creative and see just how far your vocabulary can take you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Fun Items</strong>: Every word you form brings you closer to  unlocking new items. Keep going and see what surprises you can create!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/63aa93a7bb5c496aebe71bdc3b577341.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine some letters, make some words, get some cool stuff it\u2019s that simple. Whether you\u2019re here to flex your vocab or just chill and see what you find, there\u2019s always something fun waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Nodes of Letters</strong>: dive into a world full of possibilities! Strategically gather the letters you need, piece them together, and see what words (and surprises) you can create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/ea0ba5f02ba71d9d7de77928c4ba0fdc.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine Letters into Words</strong>: The longer and more clever your creations, the bigger the rewards! Get creative and see just how far your vocabulary can take you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.poster.avif?t=1746519878\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.webm?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342770/extras/b21e1e31ff75901ee527c63ad5093f4a.mp4?t=1746519878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Fun Items</strong>: Every word you form brings you closer to  unlocking new items. Keep going and see what surprises you can create!</p></li></ul>",
